# Cline project adapter

The canonical project instructions are in `AGENTS.md`.

Before doing any work, read these files in order:

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `README.md`
3. `docs/progress.md`
4. `git status`

Follow `AGENTS.md` for repository boundaries, safety, validation, deployment,
and documentation maintenance. Do not duplicate those rules here. In
particular, never auto-deploy, commit, push, or mutate production merely because
a code edit is complete; require the approval specified in `AGENTS.md`.
